sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Watchdog
    participant T as Telegram
    participant O as Operator
    participant N as Worker
    W->>T: Ask with nonce
    T->>O: Show question
    O->>T: Reply with nonce
    W->>T: Poll up to 20 min
    T-->>W: Approved
    W->>N: Run cleanup
    W->>T: Report result
